sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Roster Manager UI
    participant Hook as useRecognitionObservations
    participant API as WP REST API
    participant Manager as RosterObservationManager
    participant Repo as ObservationRepository
    participant Roster as RosterService
    participant Backend as Recognition API

    Note over UI,Backend: Recognition Observation Workflow

    UI->>Hook: Load observations (status: needs_review)
    Hook->>API: GET /cat/v1/observations?status=needs_review
    API->>Repo: Query observations from post_meta
    Repo-->>API: Return observation records + attachments
    API-->>Hook: Observation list with confidence scores
    Hook-->>UI: Display pending observations panel

    Note over UI: Operator reviews observation<br/>(face detection with unknown identity)

    alt Create New Roster Entry
        UI->>UI: User clicks "Create new entry"
        UI->>UI: Opens roster editor with observation context
        UI->>API: POST /context-alt-text/v1/roster
        Note over API,Manager: Creates local roster entry
        API->>Roster: createAndSync(label, type, metadata)
        Roster->>Backend: POST /api/v0/roster (upsert embedding)
        Backend-->>Roster: Remote ID assigned
        Roster-->>API: RosterEntry with remoteId
        API->>Manager: autoAssignPending(remoteId)
        Manager->>Repo: Update matching observations in post_meta
        Repo->>Repo: Set observation status to "assigned"
        API-->>UI: Entry created + observations auto-assigned
    else Assign to Existing Entry
        UI->>API: PATCH /cat/v1/observations/{id}
        Note over API,Manager: Assigns observation to roster entry
        API->>Manager: assignObservation(observationId, remoteId)
        Manager->>Repo: Update observation status in post_meta
        Repo->>Repo: Link observation to remoteId
        API-->>UI: Observation assigned
    else Dismiss/Ignore
        UI->>API: PATCH /cat/v1/observations/{id}
        Note over API,Repo: Marks observation as reviewed
        API->>Repo: Update status to "dismissed" in post_meta
        Repo-->>API: Observation hidden from queue
        API-->>UI: Observation dismissed
    end

    UI->>Hook: Refetch observations
    Hook->>API: GET /cat/v1/observations?status=needs_review
    API-->>Hook: Updated observation list
    Hook-->>UI: Refresh panel (pending count updated)

    Note over UI,Backend: Observations enable incremental roster building<br/>as recognition jobs discover new faces
